			"notes": "Added a configuration option to switch between the new flight AI and the old flight AI. For Super Android 17, added configuration options to adjust the conversion rate of absorbed Ki attacks into attack power, the maximum attack power increase per absorption, and the overall attack power increase limit.\n\nmonsters no longer relentlessly attack a single player until death; instead, after being attacked multiple times by another player, they will switch to targeting that player.\n\nSuper Android 17 gains the ability to increase attack power by absorbing Ki from attacks, and the teleportation issue has been fixed."
		},
